# .env.example — template for local environment.
#
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in real values: cp .env.example .env
#
# Loading order (first match wins):
#   1. variables already exported in your shell
#   2. .env, loaded explicitly by your tooling or direnv — nothing here is
#      loaded implicitly by the scaffold. For Python: `uv run --env-file .env`.
#
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=
